{"parse": {"title": "TSW-06", "pageid": 100959, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TSW-05\" title=\"TSW-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TSW-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/TSW-07\" title=\"TSW-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TSW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9C.80.E9.95.BF.E7.9A.84.E9.A1.B9.E9.93.BE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"最长的项链\">最长的项链</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 最长的项链</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Longest Necklace</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>为<span class=\"color-value\"></span>什<span class=\"color-value\"></span>么<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>完<span class=\"color-value\"></span>整<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>缺<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192306</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与奔跑相对的是，坐到她身边时的悄然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>湖面静谧，承载着长久的凝视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>芭卡洛儿小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>久久的停顿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>长长的贝壳项链垂下，被她反复摩挲，每一道纹路都如此深刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>芭卡洛儿小姐，我还记得你说过，你自己下定决心要离开家乡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轮船上夜的海风曾经拂过，三个女孩谈了心事，有人秘而不宣，有人任其漫流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我很想知道……那是什么样的感觉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面临这个问题，芭卡洛儿陷入回忆之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她想起自己决定出走的那一日，她站在克雷莫纳的广场上，远远眺望河港，想象着更遥远的海面。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_bakaluoer1\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_bakaluoer1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer1.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer1.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer1.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只白鸽骤然飞起，掠过屋檐，等它下一次展翅，芭卡洛儿已经坐在船上了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_bakaluoer2\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_bakaluoer2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer2.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer2.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer2.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_bakaluoer2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>吹着海风，她满心欢喜。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从未设想过有人会问她这个问题，一位在海浪间前行的乐手，人们默认了她具备应对一切的勇气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芭卡洛儿看着图图石子，她这处在截然不同的世界里的朋友，会得到一个截然不同的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她很犹豫，却还是开了口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>那个时候……我很开心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>在克雷莫纳，大家只谈论和演奏小提琴，我不想只听一种乐器，所以我决定离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我要去更多地方，收集世界上所有乐器，聆听它们，演奏它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>从前如此，现在如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子，“家乡”对每个人而言都是不一样的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……克雷莫纳对我来说，也是不一样的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>在旅途之中，我也会想念它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>可以说，只有离开了克雷莫纳，我才会想念它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这回答使海岛的女孩陷入沉思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝壳在她的摩挲下互触，发出轻响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>你是对的……芭卡洛儿小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我们生活在岛上，对外面的世界一无所知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>因为这样，我们从来不好奇外面的世界是什么样子，对我们眼前的一切感到满足。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>努库泰澳人不会离开家乡太久，我们的航向永远只有一个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>或许……这也正因为我们太害怕迷失航向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>芭卡洛儿小姐，努库泰澳人在岛上出海、捕鱼、种植，接触的人只有家人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我们甚至不太信任与我们交易的商人们，因为他们都是“岛外”的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>所以当小岛沉没的时候，我们才轻信了不该信任的人。那个时候，我们失去了理智。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>事实上，从登船的那一刻，我就已经动摇了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>你是说……你当时已经开始觉得，外面的世界其实没有他们说的那么可怕吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海岛的女孩轻轻地点了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我看到船员们叫喊着，他们脸上的表情看上去是那样快乐，就像举办完贸易节的努库泰澳人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我看到那个女孩——那个也在箱子里的女孩，她拥有一艘自己的船，她那样骄傲，引人注目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>还有你，芭卡洛儿小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>客人们登上“自由海风号”，即使他们来自世界各地，也会惊叹你的演奏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的评价如此诚实，不顾眼前的乐手眼神闪烁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>图图石子的目光投向湖面的远处，她的心和目光一样坦然，但有些矛盾总像麻绳一团，解开之后，又缠绕在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>那时候我想，如果这是一个只有仇恨、绝望和愤怒的世界，为什么大家都那么快乐，沉醉其中？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>如果我们错了，海洋其实风平浪静，它又为什么吞没了我们的小岛？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子……我想这并不是谁的错误，而是我们经过了一场前所未有的……海上的风雨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它几乎将所有人都拖进大海深处，毫不留情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>起初，我想乘船去世界各地看看，瞧瞧别的地方的人们手里拿着什么乐器，又演奏着怎样的乐曲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>在我见识到那些乐器之前，我却先看到了船上的客人，你说得没错，他们毫无疑问地拥有快乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>当我在游轮上演奏时，他们大部分人都想听自己家乡的歌曲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>无论这让他们觉得宽慰，还是感到悲伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她想起那些聆听着家乡乐曲的客人，音乐往往使他们有几瞬的喜悦，但更多的是长久的沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子，看到他们之后，我发现这个世界上好像没有永远快乐的人，每个人都有自己的遗憾。我们……我们也是这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>是啊，芭卡洛儿小姐……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>这个道理，也只有等我们登上船之后才明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>即使这样……即使这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我还是觉得，我们付出了太大的代价……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拿起自己的贝壳项链，那些贝壳形状各异，时间的痕迹也有所不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>在努库泰澳，如果你信赖一个人，就会仔细地选一枚贝壳，再用心打磨它，把它串到那个人的贝壳项链之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>如果有一个人深受所有人的爱戴，这个人就会拥有最长最长的贝壳项链。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>走起路来，垂到脚踝，然后把它叠起来，绕过脖子，第二圈，第三圈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>图图石子有长长的贝壳项链，她深受着努库泰澳人的信任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我一直想要拥有最长最长的贝壳项链。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>然后我们永远……永远在努库泰澳，和哥哥、托阿、塞洛尼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我们永远在一起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她哽咽着，久久地、深深地凝望着湖面。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_ye\"><img alt=\"hubian_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-hubian_ye.png/600px-Cg-hubian_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-hubian_ye.png/900px-Cg-hubian_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-hubian_ye.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她终于无法再独自承受这么巨大的悲伤，对着平静的湖面，深深地弯下了腰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将脸紧紧地埋进自己的掌心，身体剧烈地颤抖着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼泪穿过指缝，一颗一颗地落入湖水之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>图图石子大哭了起来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_gouhuo\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_gouhuo\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我总记得哥哥对我说，我们不能离开家乡太久，否则……否则我们的贝壳就会生出裂纹，永远无法弥补。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>哥哥走了，托阿走了，我们离开了努库泰澳，这些贝壳……它们还是那么完整。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310916.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310916.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>哥哥，卡穆塔……我、我多么希望你说的是真的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310916.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310916.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我多么希望你说的是真的啊……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TSW-06"}}